---
import { CONTROLLER, PLATFORM_NAME } from "astro:env/client";
import ArticleLayout from "#src/layouts/ArticleLayout.astro";
import emails from "#shared/email.json";
import Link from "#src/components/Link.astro";
import Strong from "#src/components/Strong.astro";
import Ul from "#src/components/Ul.astro";
---

<ArticleLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  </Fragment>

  <h1 class="text-center text-3xl">Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p class="my-6 text-zinc-400">
    <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> is committed to protecting your privacy. This platform does not track users for advertising or
    analytics.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl text-zinc-300">1. Data collected by the platform</h2>
  <Ul class="mbs-3">
    <li>
      <Strong>Account data:</Strong> email addresses, contact names, passkeys, OAuth IDs...
    </li>
    <li>
      <Strong>Profile content:</Strong> links, text, images...
    </li>
    <li>
      <Strong>Reports:</Strong> reported profiles, email addresses and names of reporters, messages...
    </li>
  </Ul>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">2. Data collected by third-parties</h2>
  <p class="my-3 text-zinc-400">
    Technical data is processed by{" "}
    <Link href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Cloudflare
    </Link>{" "}
    (IP and browser information for security purposes).
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    Microsoft Azure Email Communication Services is the service used to send transactional emails to users. They may process or even
    blacklist email addresses that resulted in a hard bounce or spam complaints.
  </p>
  <p class="my-3 text-zinc-400">
    Payments inside the platform are handled by{" "}
    <Link href="https://polar.sh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Polar.sh
    </Link>
    .
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    Profiles may embed content from third parties (e.g., YouTube, Spotify). When you visit a profile containing an iframe and agree to
    display them, these third parties may process your IP address and set cookies. <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> does not control these
    third parties; please refer to their respective privacy policies. For full details on cookies see the{" "}
    <Link href="/i/cookie">Cookie Policy</Link> page.
  </p>
  <p class="mbs-3 text-zinc-400">
    This website, <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> platform and user profiles may display links to external websites, whose privacy
    practices <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> is not responsible for.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">3. Purpose and legal basis</h2>
  <Ul class="mbs-3">
    <li>
      <Strong>Contract performance:</Strong> account creation, profiles...
    </li>
    <li>
      <Strong>Legitimate interest: </Strong>security via Cloudflare
    </li>
    <li>
      <Strong>Legal obligation:</Strong> tax, anti-fraud
    </li>
  </Ul>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">4. Data storage and processors</h2>
  <Ul class="mbs-3">
    <li>
      <Strong>Hosting:</Strong>{" "}
      <Link href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Microsoft Azure
      </Link>{" "}
      - Spain Central and North Europe (Ireland)
    </li>
    <li>
      <Strong>Images:</Strong>{" "}
      <Link href="https://www.backblaze.com/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Backblaze B2
      </Link>{" "}
      - EU Central (Amsterdam)
    </li>
    <li>
      <Strong>CDN:</Strong>{" "}
      <Link href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Cloudflare
      </Link>{" "}
      and{" "}
      <Link href="https://www.jsdelivr.com/terms/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        jsDelivr
      </Link>
    </li>
    <li>
      <Strong>Payments:</Strong>{" "}
      <Link href="https://polar.sh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Polar.sh
      </Link>
    </li>
  </Ul>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">5. Your GDPR rights</h2>
  <p class="my-3 text-zinc-400">Access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, objection, and withdrawal of consent.</p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    Contact: <Link href={`mailto:${emails.contact}`}>{emails.contact}</Link>
  </p>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">6. Public profiles and external archiving</h2>
  <p class="my-3 text-zinc-400">
    Profiles are public by default and they are accessible to anyone on the internet. As a result, their content may be:
  </p>
  <Ul>
    <li>Indexed by search engines (Google, Bing, etc.).</li>
    <li>Archived by third-party services such as the Internet Archive (Wayback Machine) or similar public archiving tools.</li>
  </Ul>
  <p class="mbs-3 text-zinc-400">
    <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> does not control these external services and cannot guarantee that content will be removed from them,
    even if you delete a profile later. By creating a profile, you acknowledge and accept that its content may remain publicly available and
    archived indefinitely by the third-party services mentioned above.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">7. Data retention</h2>
  <p class="my-3 text-zinc-400">
    If your account was not active for 6 years, <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> may email you to ask if you want to keep your account. If
    you do not respond within 30 days, the account will be deleted, along with all associated profiles with no other members.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    After you delete or update content in your account or profiles, it may take a few minutes for those changes to become visible.
  </p>
  <p class="my-3 text-zinc-400">
    When an account is deleted, some data can remain in the <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> systems for up to 15 days.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> may blacklist email addresses that resulted in a hard bounce or spam complaints. If you think your
    email address was blacklisted by mistake, you can contact at <Link href={`mailto:${emails.contact}`}>{emails.contact}</Link>.
  </p>
  <p class="my-3 text-zinc-400">
    When a report is made to a profile, the report information will remain in the <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> systems for up to 15 days
    after the report is resolved.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    A user who has been banned remains in the system from 15 days to 180 days, depending on the severity of the ban.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">8. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p class="mbs-3 text-zinc-400">
    This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time to reflect changes or legal requirements. Material changes will be notified to
    registered users.
  </p>

  <p class="mbs-8 border-bs border-zinc-700 pbs-8 text-zinc-400 select-none">{CONTROLLER}</p>

  <p class="my-6 text-zinc-400">
    For full details on cookies see the <Link href="/i/cookie">Cookie Policy</Link> page.
  </p>

  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    For information regarding the governing law and jurisdiction, please refer to the <Link href="/i/legal-notice">Legal Notice</Link> page.
  </p>

  <p class="mbs-6 text-zinc-500">Last updated: April 2026</p>
</ArticleLayout>
